[en.EVENT_C08_RADIO_4]
Voice of Friendship

[en.EVENT_C08_RADIO_4_desc]
Equestria, Our home.
Prosperity, Liberty, Harmony.
(An enthusiastic stallion is greeting the ponies around him)
Our way of life.
(Suddenly the Empire’s army appears)
But freedom doesn’t come free.
(The stallion kneels down, despairingly shouts)
“Sweet Harmony! No!”
——INVASION——
(A stallion enters from the left of the screen)
Haha, look familiar?
Scenes like this are happening all over Equestria, right now!
You could be next.
That is, unless you make the most important decision of your life.
(Snap, an epic music)
Prove to yourself that you have the strength and the courage to be free.
Join, the Resistance!
(Intense battle scenes)
Become part of an elite peacekeeping force
See exotic new lifeforms
And spread Managed Harmony throughout Equestria
Become a hero, become a legend
Become a Resistance fighter!

